{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic\/Content-swift.enum"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic\/Content-swift.enum\/natural"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The natural element indicates that this is a natural harmonic. These are usually notated at base pitch rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than sounding pitch."}],"metadata":{"title":"MXLHarmonic.Content.natural","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLHarmonicV7ContentO7naturalyA2EmF","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Case","symbolKind":"case","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"natural","kind":"identifier"}]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"natural","kind":"identifier"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlharmonic\/content-swift.enum\/natural"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLHarmonic/Content-swift.enum/natural":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlharmonic\/content-swift.enum\/natural","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"MXLHarmonic.Content.natural","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic\/Content-swift.enum\/natural","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The natural element indicates that this is a natural harmonic. These are usually notated at base pitch rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than sounding pitch."}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"natural","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Ivor